§ `ss 27-30`

#ASSERT `failing to lodge is an offence` TRUE FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `failing to lodge is an offence` TRUE FALSE FALSE

#ASSERT `giving false information is an offence` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `giving false information is an offence` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE
